<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's BUX ends officially at a new closing hig.</title>
<headline>Hungary's BUX ends officially at a new closing hig.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The BUX index of the Budapest Stock Exchange finished officially at a new closing high of 6,795.00 points, up 10.34 points, unchanged from the preliminary figures.</p>
<p>Spot share turnover totalled 4.622 billion forints, up from 4.150 billion forints.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
